<li>Pilot segmentation with one bounded journey plus holdout measurement.</li>
<li>Choose a review window covering the relevant purchase and return cycle; report uncertainty when the sample is small.</li>
<li>Scale segmentation only once a second operator edits safely.</li>
<li>Segmentation peak policy locks edits, codes, cadence.</li>
<li>Compare incremental contribution with matched all-in costs: platform, data integrations, creative, discounts, returns and staff effort over the same period.</li>
<li>Segmentation hygiene: unreviewed flows simplified or cut.</li>
</ol>
